### atlas-api — requisições de teste (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client)
### Ajuste @port conforme a env PORT da API (default do main.go: 8081).

@port = 8081
@baseUrl = http://localhost:{{port}}
@name = payments
@dbName = orders

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Listar catálogo
GET {{baseUrl}}/services

### Obter um serviço (anexa sync/health se ARGOCD_* estiver configurado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/services/{{name}}

### Criar serviço (sem banco) — espera 201; replay idêntico depois → 200
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "language": "go",
  "replicas": 2
}

### Criar serviço (com banco) — habilita a ligação Postgres no chart
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{dbName}}",
  "language": "go",
  "replicas": 2,
  "database": { "enabled": true, "type": "postgres" },
  "env": [
    { "name": "LOG_LEVEL", "value": "info" }
  ]
}

### Replay idempotente — mesmo spec de {{name}} → espera HTTP 200 (no-op, não reprovisiona)
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "language": "go",
  "replicas": 2
}

### Conflito — mesmo nome, spec diferente → espera HTTP 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "{{name}}",
  "language": "go",
  "replicas": 5
}

### Validação — payload inválido → espera HTTP 422 com fields[]
POST {{baseUrl}}/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Invalid_Name",
  "language": "rust",
  "replicas": 99
}

### Deletar (arquiva o repo — reversível) → 202 com os teardown PRs
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/services/{{name}}

### Deletar com force (deleta repo + pacote; para testes) → 202
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/services/{{dbName}}?force=true
